\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  I was full of sin, in darkness
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and wished to be in the light
\par Jesus, come and brighten my life
\par Let me see in your glory.
\par I look for you let me see you
\par O reveal thyself to me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Look, I've found out that all my sins
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 is the root cause of my woes
\par I confess and plead to you that:
\par Son of David, have mercy
\par you are the one who gave my life
\par and you gave me a new life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Out of my heart and my problems
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I look out for my Saviour;
\par And my sins make me to panic
\par So my Jesus, come to me
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 I will follow you come down now
\par You alone my heart desire.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   Strengthen me in truth and wisdom
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 that I walk in your great light
\par Take your spirit and your love to
\par fill my heart and make me full
\par What grace ever that thou give me
\par I am yours and you are mine.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Let me see you open my eyes show me
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 what I ought to do
\par let me reach to your truthful light
\par that I may take to your life.
\par Let also my works bear witness
\par \pard     that your light has come to me.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

